Prerequisites
Install the required libraries:

sudo apt install libsdl2-dev
sudo apt install libsdl2-image-dev
sudo apt install libgtk-3-dev

Usage
Cutting:
./cutting <image_path> <word_or_option>
Detects the grid, words, and letters in the image. 
The extracted letters are then cropped and stored 
in the image_storage directory.

Solver:
./solver <grid_path> <searched_word>
Searches for the specified word in the grid and returns its starting 
and ending coordinates if found.

Learn:
./learn
Runs the neural network training and displays the learning results 
using the XOR problem.

APP:
./app
Applies image preprocessing, including rotation correction 
and black-and-white conversion.